Z||000000||Swany||06-06-2001||02:50 PM||||Just wanted to make a quick update, I posted here last week with my dash light probs. <P>Well, they are working now, thanks for the help guys. This forum is great. Its very reassuring with my first Fiero, to know that I can find help and answers when I need it. You guys are great. <P>Ogre, you were right on with the transister. After I pulled it completely off, took it apart, cleaned it up, put it back together, they just started working.. <P>Think I got one of my oil leaks taken care of last weekend, the seal on the oil pan was bad. After finding the right gasket, got that taken care of. <P>In case you don't remember, 2 weeks ago I bought a 86 GT with an automatic. 87,000 miles on the car.. <P>still got a few other seals to go though, i'm still leaking a little bit, but nothing too serious. <P>thanks again.. ||||reg||1
